+ * "Send to" and Quick access pins (Stained Glass OS)
+ *
+ * The item menu's Send to submenu -- whatever is in the user's SendTo folder
+ * (shortcuts to programs and folders, folders, programs, "Desktop (create
+ * shortcut)", "Documents", and a file type's own drop command, which is how
+ * "Compressed (zipped) Folder" reaches sg-zip) and the removable drives --
+ * and File Explorer's Quick access pins, which the same menu offers for
+ * folders.
